== C1 significances ==
paper l.55: 2.5, 3.5, 3.9 | l.128: 2.5, 3.5, 3.9 | DESI VI v3 l.907: 2.5, 3.5, 3.9
match: PASS
  Delta chi2_MAP -8.7, k=2 -> 2.4863 sigma -> half-up 2.5 vs printed 2.5: PASS
     (k=1 would give 2.950; sqrt(-dchi2) = 2.950)
  Delta chi2_MAP -15.2, k=2 -> 3.4805 sigma -> half-up 3.5 vs printed 3.5: PASS
     (k=1 would give 3.899; sqrt(-dchi2) = 3.899)
  Delta chi2_MAP -18.1, k=2 -> 3.8515 sigma -> half-up 3.9 vs printed 3.9: PASS
     (k=1 would give 4.254; sqrt(-dchi2) = 4.254)
DESI VI describes them as Delta chi2_MAP between the w0waCDM MAP and the MAP at (w0, wa) = (-1, 0): a likelihood (posterior-maximum) ratio; the paper's 'based on a likelihood-ratio comparison' (l.128): PASS
DESI VI's stated MAP scatter on the significances: 0.2 sigma

